minios-image-builder (1.0.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a selectable temporary work directory, with storage capacity,
    filesystem type and RAM-use guidance during review.
  * Validate temporary storage ownership, permissions, private-directory
    support and identity before starting the build.
  * Keep output and temporary work files outside captured OverlayFS and AUFS
    layers, including changes directories and bind-mount aliases.
  * Allow further customization of images containing earlier session-capture
    or Image Builder layers while reserving generated names for the builder.
  * Prevent long custom boot-entry titles from resizing the default-entry
    selector.
  * Update all supported translations and extend storage, capture and
    iterative-customization regression coverage.
  * Recommend aufs-ng-capable MiniOS Tools for live-session capture.
  * Run Python and CLI regression suites during package builds.
  * Exercise image and SquashFS integration tests in clean package builds.

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 01:26:53 +0300

